OL,3,GNEWSACathedral marks 25 years since
OL,4,A'catastrophic' fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cathedral is holding an event to mark
OL,7,F25 years since a "catastrophic" fire
OL,8,Fthreatened to destroy it.
OL,10,FThe fire broke out in a stack of
OL,11,Fplastic chairs in Peterborough
OL,12,FCathedral on 22 November 2001,
OL,13,Fresulting in extensive smoke damage to
OL,14,Fstonework and the windows.
OL,16,FThe cathedral said at the time it was
OL,17,F"only thanks to the prompt actions of
OL,18,Fthe Cambridgeshire Fire and Rescue
OL,19,FService" that the building was saved.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
